{"id": "34525", "title": "无敌熊的小玫瑰", "author": "陈毓华", "category": "文学名著", "count": 41, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34525.htm", "intro": "他穷到没钱吃饭！只好拚命打工度日，虽然傲气依旧，但仍敌不过饥饿感，快饿昏的他，不巧倒在女厕旁，被这全校知名的男人婆误认在偷窥，对他大加挞伐，害他百口莫辩，不过一听到他肚子发出的咕噜声，她竟拉着他的手，进面包店搜括一番，之后却说她不饿，把所有食物都留给他，为了还人情，他狂打了几个月的工，买了只价格不菲的泰迪熊给她，希望从此互不相欠，最好老死不相往来，没想到十一年后，她救了车祸伤重的他，唉！他只好以身相许报救命大恩喽……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34525", "chapters": [{"title": "楔子", "file": "2190365.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2190366.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2190367.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2190368.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2190369.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2190370.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2190371.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2190372.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2190373.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2190374.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2190375.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2190376.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2190377.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2190378.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2190379.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2190380.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2190381.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2190382.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2190383.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2190384.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2190385.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2190386.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2190387.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2190388.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file": "2190389.html", "avai